NList.mcc/MUIA_NList_SkipChars

    NAME
        MUIA_NList_SkipChars -- [ISG], char *

    FUNCTION
        Same function as Floattext.mui/MUIA_Floattext_SkipChars.
NList.mcc/MUIA_NList_SortType

    NAME
        MUIA_NList_SortType -- Store the primary comparison value.

    INPUTS
        Initialize/set/get/notify; LONG. Default MUIV_NList_SortType_None
        (0xF0000000).

    FUNCTION
        Store the value supplied to MUIM_NList_Compare and the corresponding
        CompareHook2 message field. The default Stricmp comparison ignores
        it; its meaning belongs to the custom comparison policy.
        SortType_None is a stored value, not a local switch that disables
        Sort.

        Setting this attribute does not sort the list and does not clear the
        internal sorted flag. If the comparison policy changes, explicitly
        sort the whole list before relying on incremental sorted insertion.
        The setter leaves the tag for superclass notification; get returns
        the stored value.

    SEE ALSO
        MUIM_NList_Sort, MUIM_NList_Sort2, MUIM_NList_Sort3,
        MUIA_NList_CompareHook2

NList.mcc/MUIA_NList_SortType2

    NAME
        MUIA_NList_SortType2 -- Store the secondary comparison value.

    INPUTS
        Initialize/set/get/notify; LONG. Default MUIV_NList_SortType_None
        (0xF0000000).

    FUNCTION
        Store the value supplied to MUIM_NList_Compare and the corresponding
        CompareHook2 message field. The default Stricmp comparison ignores
        it; its meaning belongs to the custom comparison policy.
        SortType_None is a stored value, not a local switch that disables
        Sort.

        Setting this attribute does not sort the list and does not clear the
        internal sorted flag. If the comparison policy changes, explicitly
        sort the whole list before relying on incremental sorted insertion.
        The setter leaves the tag for superclass notification; get returns
        the stored value.

    SEE ALSO
        MUIM_NList_Sort, MUIM_NList_Sort2, MUIM_NList_Sort3,
        MUIA_NList_CompareHook2

